Z||000001||Joe Torma||08-13-2001||05:13 AM||||No cost???...I'm 'fraid not...aside from stuff made from scraps(bought).<P>Low cost?  Yes...I don't spend lots of late nights at the 24hour Home Cheapo(Depot) searching for inexpensive adaptable pieces for nothin'.<P>Want to set a $$$ limit on these mods?<P>Joe<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 08-13-2001).]||||reg||1
