Z||000003||KissMySSFiero||08-13-2001||12:19 PM||||ive done a cold air intake for about $40 with PVC and a $35 k&n air filter and some misc pieces for the sensors.  <P>poly isnt too expensive if you dont mind diggin into the suspension but i would recomend an allignment after so it probably would go over $100<P>if you dont have the aux. guages you could do that for less than $50 i would think.  <P>paint the small stuff...mirrors, interior trim pieces, engine grills, get a cheap spoiler from a junk yard(camaros are all over)maybe $10-$25.  <P>do a search on this im sure its been covered before.  <P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>      <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>       <P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">           <BR>"Kids in the backseat cause accidents,  accidents in the backseat caused me!!"||||reg||1
Z||000004||Philphine||08-13-2001||12:34 PM||||i think the various speaker pods i made might have been that cheap. just the cost of fiberglass, wood and paint. dosen't include speakers of course.<P>hood vents would have been about that cheap except that i got another hood to try it on. that would depend on what vents you find and how brave you are with your hood.<P>a cheap wing if you don't have one already and don't mind something different. mustang wings fit good and there are plenty out there to maybe come across a deal.||||reg||1
Z||000005||88CoupeV6||08-13-2001||01:38 PM||||Here you go, Everything I will show was under $20<P>1. My Pontiac lights. I just masked off and painted red then removed the mask and painted black <BR>[b]This is a super old pic. Before paint and lots of other stuff.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/May19^101_1.jpg"> <P>2. Here I used the cover from a 86 owners manual to make a custom look. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=9233482&p=30056786&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>3. I took the gas tank door ring off and painted it gloss black, I also added a cool Fiero sticker above the air intake scoop.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=9233482&p=30056864&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>4. I got these white gauge faces on ebay for $14.00<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=9233482&p=37735136&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>5. I painted the Fiero emblems on the door in gold to give it a great look <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=9233482&p=30056789&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>6. I got this red loom from JC Whitney and I think it really dresses the motor up.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1249362&a=12780538&p=51258174&Sequence=0&res=high"> ||||reg||7
