Z||000008||mrfixit58||08-13-2001||01:52 PM||||Don't forget the short shifter. Cut, grind, weld. Almost no $$$ if you have the equipment, probably $5 to $20 to pay someone else to do it.<P>I found a Holley side scoop at the bone yard for $1. cleaned, painted, installed next to nothing.<P>How about a Pine Tree air freshener?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy :D<BR>87 GT   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000009||qwikgta||08-14-2001||11:08 PM||||Homemade center council - $3<BR>Short shifter - free<BR>clear tail lights - free<BR>Paint roof black - $3<BR>Rear lid strut - $2 (Yea $2 read post <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/012758.html)" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/012758.html)</A> <BR>hood vents - &lt;$5<BR>engine dress up - $4 (per can of paint)<BR>paint speaker covers in dash - &lt;$4<BR>remove deck lid grills - free<BR>add remote op rear view mirror off mid 90's GM - &lt;$5 (with wires)<BR>open element air cleaner - &lt;10 (+$30 for K&N)<P>Several of these have pics on my web site in my sig <P>ROb<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>qwikgta@yahoo.com<BR>88 T-Top coupe, 65K, Header no Cat, 16" GTZ rims, short shifter, swaybar, open element air cleaner, hood vents.<BR>http://www.homestead.com/robsfieroproject   <BR>http://www.vafieros.com<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
